@AgentShield.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5102

### Liveness (process up)
GET {{AgentShield.Api_HostAddress}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

### Readiness (dependencies)
GET {{AgentShield.Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### Overall health
GET {{AgentShield.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: manual-check-001

### Unknown route -> 404 Problem Details with correlationId/errorCode
GET {{AgentShield.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/does-not-exist
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{AgentShield.Api_HostAddress}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
